  titleText: Interview with Chief Police Officer - Part 2
  descriptionText: The gas in question was ozone, which was progressively leaked,
    reaching a deadly level at around 9am. There were reports of students feeling
    unwell, but the personnel was not able to tie the knots until around 8:50 am
    (end of first period) and the communication and evacuation wasn't fast enough
    to avoid casualties.
